+ * first message and asks for the other drain: same bytes, a second handshake on the same instance.
+ *
+ * DRAIN 1 AND 3 MUST PRODUCE THE SAME BYTES. Both are legal drains and only the wait differs, so
+ * the sweep is also the guard for the change that makes the fused kernel honour the argument
